gametitle=Final Fantasy X (NTSC-U) (SLUS-20312) [BB3D833A]
// Cleaned for AetherSX2 / NetherSX2
//
// HOW TO USE IN AETHERSX2:
// 1. Every cheat below is DISABLED by default (commented with //patch=).
// 2. AetherSX2 activates ALL uncommented patch= lines simultaneously.
//    Remove the leading "//" ONLY on the specific cheats you want active.
// 3. Do NOT enable conflicting cheats at the same time (e.g., In Party + Not In Party).
// 4. Only enable Party / Aeon / Stat cheats AFTER completing the Sphere Grid tutorial.
// 5. For auto-loading from AetherSX2 cheats folder, name this file BB3D833A.pnach
//    (or import it directly via Pause Menu -> Patch Codes -> Import).

// ============================================================================
// QUICK ACCESS: POPULAR & SAFE CHEATS
// ============================================================================

